  "atomic_questions": [
    "Is that correct, or is there any scenario where a product could be processed on A but not B (or vice versa) within the planning period?"
  ],
  "rationale": "The response asks for confirmation of a single constraint (flow balance between A and B) or an exception to it, which constitutes one semantically independent clarification question."
}

